@startuml

package "Infrastructure / Auth" {

    class RefreshToken {
        + Id : Guid <<PK>>
        + UserId : Guid <<FK>>
        + Token : string
        + ExpiresAt : DateTime
        + CreatedAt : DateTime
    }
}

note right of RefreshToken
    屬於 Infrastructure 層，非 Domain
    UserId → User Aggregate
    Token 過期後不主動刪除，查詢時判斷 ExpiresAt
end note

@enduml
